Block65 patched build of tsgolint 7.0.2001
==========================================

This package is built from https://github.com/block65/tsgolint, branch
block65/v7.0.2001, a fork of https://github.com/oxc-project/tsgolint at tag
v7.0.2001. Upstream tsgolint is the work of auvred and the oxc project
contributors; their LICENSE and copyright apply unchanged. The fork adds, on
top of the upstream tag: the checker shim exposes getUnionType,
getStringLiteralType and undefinedType; four rules are added under
internal/rules and registered in cmd/tsgolint (define-messages-keys,
no-widening-alias, no-widening-object-keys, no-widening-return-type), ported
from the block65 oxlint plugin; the npm packages are renamed to
@block65/oxlint-tsgolint; and CI is reduced to a release workflow. It is
maintained by Block65 and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the oxc project.
